=== TCP (SOCK_STREAM) Example ===
TCP Socket Type: 1
TCP Characteristics:
- Connection-oriented
- Reliable data delivery
- Ordered data transmission
- Error checking and correction
- Stream reliability adds protocol overhead; performance depends on workload

=== UDP (SOCK_DGRAM) Example ===
UDP Socket Type: 2
UDP Characteristics:
- Connectionless
- No delivery guarantee
- No order guarantee
- Minimal error checking
- Datagram overhead is lower; application performance depends on workload

=== Socket Options Demo ===
SO_REUSEADDR: 0
Receive Buffer Size: 131072 bytes
Send Buffer Size: 16384 bytes
SO_REUSEADDR enabled

